+> This curated list covers the best AI tools for small businesses in 2026 that you can actually inspect, fork, and self-host from public GitHub repositories. Instead of SaaS roundups full of closed products, this repository focuses on verified GitHub projects for workflow automation, internal chat, document Q&A, agent orchestration, developer productivity, and meeting intelligence.
