+## FAQ
+
+### What are the best open source AI tools for small businesses in 2026?
+For broad usefulness, start with `n8n`, `Dify`, `Activepieces`, `AnythingLLM`, `Open WebUI`, and `LibreChat`. Those cover the biggest SMB use cases: workflow automation, internal chat, document Q&A, and team-wide access to multiple models.
+
+### Which self-hosted AI workflow tools are good alternatives to closed automation SaaS?
+`n8n`, `Activepieces`, `Dify`, `Flowise`, and `Langflow` are the strongest GitHub-first options. They differ in focus: `n8n` and `Activepieces` lean toward business automation, while `Dify`, `Flowise`, and `Langflow` lean more toward AI apps, agents, and RAG workflows.
+
+### What open source AI chatbot can a small business deploy on its own server?
+`Open WebUI`, `LibreChat`, `AnythingLLM`, `LobeHub`, and `FastGPT` are the best starting points in this list. If you need a general team chat portal, use `Open WebUI` or `LibreChat`. If you need document-grounded answers, look first at `AnythingLLM`, `FastGPT`, or `RAGFlow`.
+
+### Which GitHub repos are best for document Q&A and retrieval-augmented generation?
+`RAGFlow`, `FastGPT`, `QAnything`, `Quivr`, `AnythingLLM`, and `Docling` are the most directly relevant. `Docling` is especially useful upstream because document parsing quality usually determines whether a RAG stack feels reliable in production.
+
+### Are there open source AI meeting tools for Google Meet, Teams, or Zoom?
+Yes, but this category is still thinner than chat or workflow automation. `Vexa` is the strongest verified repo in this list for meeting bots and transcript APIs. That thinness is real market data, not a research failure.
+
+### How should a small business evaluate GitHub AI tools before adopting them?
+Check five things first: license terms, recency of commits, install complexity, whether the project is a framework or a ready-to-run product, and whether your team needs UI polish or only backend capability. For commercial use, source-available projects with custom licenses need especially careful review.
